# Nameless Inversion: "Target creature gets +3/-3 and loses all creature types until end of turn." Bot1's Concealing
# Curtains, a 0/4 Wall, becomes a 3/1 with no creature type at all (CR 613.1d, 613.4c); it is still a creature. Both
# effects end in the cleanup step (CR 514.2), so on Bot2's turn it is a 0/4 Wall again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Concealing Curtains
Nameless Inversion
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

